ok - --fix starts a missing rex server as the persistent shape
ok - --fix never stops an answering exit-empty rex server and reports the operator restart
ok - unreadable, missing, and malformed rex persistence settings require human action
ok - a rex CLI or server below the verified API floor is a human gap
